{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ce18a23e-9118-8c55-909c-d53f8ade4fcf",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:20:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. Jorge Cabral calling. I've got a couple of things, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead, Mr. Cabral."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. First one, my trash. It wasn't picked up, and that's the second miss in a row for me. Last week and now this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Can I get the address where the pickup was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course. It's 88 Bliss Road, on the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "88 Bliss Road. Got it. And what day is your regular pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Well, it's supposed to be Monday. I had the barrel out at the curb by seven, like always, and it was still sitting there when I got home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:17:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that was yesterday, Monday the eighth. And the Monday before that, the first, also missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, absolutely, that's right. That was the one right before the nor'easter, Friday and Saturday, three days ago now. So I figured maybe the weather had the trucks backed up, but then this week too, so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:17:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Was the barrel in the usual spot, with the lid closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Right at the end of the driveway, lid shut. Nothing blocking it, no snow bank, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll put in a missed pickup report for 88 Bliss Road for yesterday. Typically if you leave it out, they try to get back to it, but I can't tell you exactly when. Is the barrel still at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yes, I left it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, leave it there for now. I'll also note that this is the second week in a row so the supervisor sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be great, thank you. Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You said you had a second question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, absolutely. It's about Christmas trees. When do they pick those up, and how do I put it out? I'm gonna be getting a real one this week, hopefully, I've been out shopping around, actually, trying to find a gift for a coworker's baby shower, so I'm kind of running around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:18:46-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, for the tree, it's usually a pickup after the holidays, in early January. The schedule gets posted on the city website and in the paper, so I'd watch for that. Generally you'd put it at the curb on your regular trash day, with no bags, no stand, no lights or tinsel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no bags, no stand, no lights. Of course. And it goes out on Monday, same as the trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same as your regular day unless the notice says otherwise. Holiday weeks can shift things by a day, so check that notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. And if it's a live tree, no wreaths mixed in or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd keep it just the tree. If you have a wreath, ask when the schedule comes out, because I don't want to tell you wrong on that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, okay. That's fine. I'll look for the notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:19:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read back the report so I have it right. Jorge Cabral, 88 Bliss Road, missed trash pickup Monday the eighth, also missed Monday the first, barrel at the curb. Do you want a call back at 401-555-0171?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the number, of course. Landline, so I'm usually home evenings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Thank you very much, Lorraine. Absolutely appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cabral. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
